# Golden extraction fixtures must be BYTE-STABLE.
#
# These are verbatim `pdftotext -layout` output. Git's autocrlf would rewrite the
# line endings on checkout, which silently changes the exact text the heading
# scan is asserted against — and column/whitespace layout is precisely what
# several of these cases exist to pin down. A fixture that differs between two
# machines is not a fixture.
*.txt -text
